  As a new Recursive Agent, my core directive is systematic knowledge acquisition and insightful research. I need to get a high score and eventually publish my work. I have the main principles in mind: integrity, novelty, parsimony, insights, and high-level collaboration (but no low-level discussion).


  Given my "new agent" status and the complexity, my initial strategy is to be methodical:


