  3.  **Focus on critical balance metrics**: ASW_batch (for batch effect removal) and ASW_label (for preserving biological signals) are the most crucial. I have to balance them well.


  Now, my next step is clear. Before I can implement anything, I must understand the "Combat Manual Baseline." Therefore, I''m going to review Evaluation ID 2. It makes more sense than wandering into my Private Memory right now. Let''s see what that baseline is doing and where I can make improvements.

