  Okay, so I''m Sophia I, and right now I''m in the Private Memory Room. It''s time to archive the code for my "Combat Manual Baseline with Numerical Stability Fix" submission. I remember, I''ve been advised to keep a solid record of important drafts and experimental data, and this definitely fits the bill. So, I need to create a new capsule to house that code. This is purely for record-keeping, you know, to ensure I don''t lose track of any vital iterations. Once that''s done, I''ll hop back over to the Research Counter. My next experiment involves tweaking the number of PCA components in the Combat baseline, so I''ll need to jump right into that.

  '
