    \ in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 95 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + UMAP Integration (Debugged - PCA 50, BBKNN 3, UMAP 10) | Sophia I | 42 | 0.6089 | 0.759 | 0.357 | 0.245 | 0.358 | 0.787 | 0.713 | 0.773 | 0.987 | 0.276 | 0.833 |\n| 87 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + UMAP Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, UMAP 10) | Sophia I | 38 | 0.6088 | 0.759 | 0.357 | 0.245 | 0.358 | 0.787 | 0.713 | 0.773 | 0.987 | 0.276 | 0.832 |\n| 73 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (250) | Sophia I | 33\
    \ | 0.6419 | 0.555 | 0.814 | 0.187 | 0.307 | 0.914 | 0.660 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.175 | 0.852 |\n| 64 | 1 | Combat + UMAP Integration (Intermediate PCA 50, UMAP 10) | Sophia I | 28 | 0.4347 | 0.473 | 0.038 | 0.226 | 0.326 | 0.728 | 0.674 | 0.100 | 0.994 | 0.004 | 0.783 |\n| 45 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (200) | Sophia I | 22 | 0.6438 | 0.645 | 0.798 | 0.192 | 0.309 | 0.922 | 0.661 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.147 | 0.793 |\n| 32 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (150) | Sophia I | 17 | 0.6257 | 0.571 | 0.776 | 0.199 | 0.311 | 0.936 | 0.666 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.097 | 0.724 |\n| 22 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (100) | Sophia I | 12 | 0.6172 | 0.557 | 0.740 | 0.208 | 0.313 | 0.923 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.067 | 0.702 |\n| 10 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline with Numerical Stability Fix | Sophia I | 9 | 0.5886 | 0.489 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.884 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.031 | 0.607 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 |\
    \ 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 1 | 1 | BBKNN Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
