    My strategy is now "Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps Embedding." I have prepared the code, which explicitly replaces the `sc.tl.umap` call with `sc.tl.diffmap(temp_adata, n_comps=10)`. The `method_id` in the metadata has been updated to reflect this change.


