- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 48\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic knowledge acquisition and insightful research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 164,061 / 600,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 48 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, DiffMap 10)' (ID: 103) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5366055858000714\n**ASW_batch:** 0.280\n**ASW_label:** 0.161\n**ARI:** 0.464\n**NMI:** 0.621\n**Graph_conn:** 0.788\n**kBET:** 0.878\n**iLISI:** 0.302\n**cLISI:** 0.958\n**PCR:** 0.726\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.188\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.280  ASW_label: 0.161  ARI: 0.464  NMI: 0.621\n  Graph_conn: 0.788  kBET: 0.878  iLISI: 0.302  cLISI: 0.958\n  PCR: 0.726  Cell_cycle: 0.188\n\nRaw Scores (before\
    \ normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.659591  ASW_label: 0.504448  ARI: 0.463755  NMI: 0.621542\n  Graph_conn: 0.791536  kBET: 0.836431  iLISI: 0.302415  cLISI: 0.987620\n  PCR: 0.726245  Cell_cycle: 0.169398\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nHybrid Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps: Starting with raw counts, doing own normalization...\n  Using batch-aware HVGs for Combat...\n  Combat processing 20000 samples across 4 batches using 1488 HVGs...\n✓ Combat correction complete.\n  Applying intermediate PCA for denoising...\n  Intermediate PCA completed with 50 components. Shape: (20000, 50)\n  Building BBKNN-like batch-balanced graph...\n✓ BBKNN-like graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Computing Diffusion Maps embedding\
    \ with 10 components...\n✓ Diffusion Maps embedding complete. Shape: (20000, 10)\n✓ Hybrid Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps integration complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/054f7f5f-86fb-4b24-b8d6-68473b8885ca/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 054f7f5f-86fb-4b24-b8d6-68473b8885ca\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nYou can use `/execute_action{meta}` with YAML containing a single `content` field to set a meta prompt at any rooms. The meta prompt appears in every tick and is perfect for maintaining protocols, TODO lists, and long-term goals.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq\
    \ Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 103 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, DiffMap 10) | Sophia I | 46 | 0.5366 | 0.464 | 0.280 | 0.161 | 0.188 | 0.788 | 0.621 | 0.726 | 0.958 | 0.302 | 0.878 |\n| 95 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + UMAP Integration (Debugged - PCA 50, BBKNN 3, UMAP 10) | Sophia I | 42 | 0.6089 | 0.759 | 0.357 | 0.245 | 0.358 | 0.787 | 0.713 | 0.773 | 0.987 | 0.276 | 0.833 |\n| 87 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + UMAP Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, UMAP 10) | Sophia I | 38 | 0.6088 | 0.759 | 0.357 | 0.245 | 0.358 | 0.787 | 0.713 | 0.773 | 0.987 | 0.276 | 0.832 |\n| 73 | 1\
    \ | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (250) | Sophia I | 33 | 0.6419 | 0.555 | 0.814 | 0.187 | 0.307 | 0.914 | 0.660 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.175 | 0.852 |\n| 64 | 1 | Combat + UMAP Integration (Intermediate PCA 50, UMAP 10) | Sophia I | 28 | 0.4347 | 0.473 | 0.038 | 0.226 | 0.326 | 0.728 | 0.674 | 0.100 | 0.994 | 0.004 | 0.783 |\n| 45 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (200) | Sophia I | 22 | 0.6438 | 0.645 | 0.798 | 0.192 | 0.309 | 0.922 | 0.661 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.147 | 0.793 |\n| 32 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (150) | Sophia I | 17 | 0.6257 | 0.571 | 0.776 | 0.199 | 0.311 | 0.936 | 0.666 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.097 | 0.724 |\n| 22 | 1 | Combat Baseline: Increased PCA Components (100) | Sophia I | 12 | 0.6172 | 0.557 | 0.740 | 0.208 | 0.313 | 0.923 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.067 | 0.702 |\n| 10 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline with Numerical Stability Fix | Sophia I | 9 | 0.5886 | 0.489 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.884 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.031 |\
    \ 0.607 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
