  Maybe it''s time to tweak Combat itself? Could there be an improvement there? My previous fix for the stability warning didn''t help, so maybe there''s something else. The BBKNN Manual Baseline had strong biological preservation but completely failed in the other metrics. I have to find a way to output a meaningful `X_emb` to keep the evaluation system happy.


