parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 57\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic knowledge acquisition and insightful research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 198,041 / 600,000 used (33%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 101**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-48-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN\n**ID:** 101\n**Tags:** pca, residualization, balanced-knn, cosine, no-alignment\n**Abstract:** Confirm neighbor sensitivity at SOTA gamma: residualize PCs with gamma=0.75 (l2=1e-3) and build a cosine, equal-quotas, 48-neighbor balanced kNN graph.\n**Score:** 0.7068232952001269\n**ASW_batch:** 0.637\n**ASW_label:** 0.224\n**ARI:** 0.724\n**NMI:** 0.691\n**Graph_conn:** 0.980\n**kBET:** 0.671\n**iLISI:** 0.938\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 0.931\n**Cell_cycle:**\
    \ 0.305\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.637  ASW_label: 0.224  ARI: 0.724  NMI: 0.691\n  Graph_conn: 0.980  kBET: 0.671  iLISI: 0.938  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 0.931  Cell_cycle: 0.305\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.820524  ASW_label: 0.540709  ARI: 0.724081  NMI: 0.691449\n  Graph_conn: 0.980344  kBET: 0.641925  iLISI: 0.938209  cLISI: 0.990524\n  PCR: 0.930672  Cell_cycle: 0.268803\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\nfrom pbagc import _normalize_log1p_inplace, _get_hvg_mask, _pca_truncated_svd\nfrom balanced_graph import build_balanced_knn\nfrom residualize import residualize_pcs_against_batch\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    n_pca_components = 50\n    n_neighbors_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    l2 = 1e-3\n   \
    \ gamma = 0.75\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n    hvg_mask = _get_hvg_mask(adata)\n    if hvg_mask.sum() < 10: hvg_mask = np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n\n    X = adata.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    if not sp.issparse(X): X = sp.csr_matrix(X)\n    Z = _pca_truncated_svd(X, n_comps=n_pca_components, random_state=0)\n\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    Z_resid = residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=l2, gamma=gamma, center=True)\n\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Z_resid\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=n_neighbors_total, method='umap', metric=metric)\n\n    C, D = build_balanced_knn(\n        Z_resid, batches, n_neighbors_total=n_neighbors_total,\n        metric=metric, weighting='binary', allocation='equal', mutual=False, symmetric=True\n    )\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities']\
    \ = C.tocsr()\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/21336f4c-6284-4740-896d-4da015cb9598/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 21336f4c-6284-4740-896d-4da015cb9598\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 10 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations)\
    \ to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 101` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n##\
    \ Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 101 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 113 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=0.5): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 57 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 112 | 1 | Innovation: UMAP on SOTA Graph | Daedalus I | 57 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 111 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Balanced kNN) | Daedalus I | 57 | running |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 110 | 1 | Daedalus's SOTA Replication: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN | Daedalus I | 56 | 0.5887 | 0.577 | 0.637 | 0.225 | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030 | 0.628 |\n| 109 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=1.5): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 55 | 0.6281 | 0.731 | 0.596 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.962 | 0.693 | 0.193 | 0.971 | 0.938 | 0.670 |\n| 108 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=1.0): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 55 | 0.6206 | 0.732 | 0.592 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.971 | 0.694 | 0.121 | 0.972 | 0.938 | 0.659 |\n| 107 | 1 | Generalization: Standard PCA Embedding & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 54 | 0.5757 | 0.755 | 0.516 | 0.208 | 0.348 | 0.920 | 0.715 | 0.000 | 0.913 | 0.854 | 0.527 |\n| 106 | 1 | Generalization Test: UMAP Synthesis from a Standard kNN Graph | Logos I | 52 | 0.4985 | 0.497 | 0.395 | 0.246 | 0.281 | 0.856 | 0.681 | 0.116 | 0.991 | 0.010 | 0.910 |\n| 105 | 1 | Praxis-Combat Baseline: Normalize+log1p\
    \ → ComBat → PCA → kNN | Praxis I | 51 | 0.6178 | 0.636 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.903 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.120 | 0.609 |\n| 104 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v8 (with Batch Mixing Loss) | Daedalus I | 47 | 0.6084 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
    \ on a new line when executing actions."
