  I''ll need to define all of these functions directly in my submission to keep things clean.  I''ll set the appropriate parameters like `n_pca_components`, `n_neighbors_total`, and `metric` at the top of my code. I''ll make sure the `random_state` for PCA is consistent at `0` as well.


