    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 120 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Residualized PCA Embedding + Balanced kNN Graph | Logos I | 62 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 119 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Correct HVG Selection) | Daedalus I | 62 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 118 | 1 | Debug: Verify Preprocessing and PCA | Daedalus I | 61 | 0.5174 | 0.775 | 0.583 | 0.223 | 0.304 | 0.892 | 0.728 | 0.000 | 0.989 | 0.066 | 0.614 |\n| 117 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Praxis I SOTA (ID 101) | Sophia I | 60 | 0.7067 | 0.724 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.691 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.938\
    \ | 0.670 |\n| 116 | 1 | Final Synthesis: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN + UMAP Embedding | Logos I | 60 | 0.6434 | 0.774 | 0.561 | 0.231 | 0.345 | 0.891 | 0.741 | 0.690 | 0.985 | 0.322 | 0.893 |\n| 115 | 1 | ComBat-PCA + BalancedGraph: Equal-Quota Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 59 | 0.7029 | 0.702 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.666 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.611 |\n| 114 | 1 | Hybrid Replication: My Code + Praxis's Graph Module | Daedalus I | 59 | 0.5892 | 0.577 | 0.637 | 0.225 | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030 | 0.632 |\n| 113 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=0.5): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 57 | 0.6123 | 0.733 | 0.588 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.970 | 0.695 | 0.044 | 0.972 | 0.938 | 0.656 |\n| 112 | 1 | Innovation: UMAP on SOTA Graph | Daedalus I | 57 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 111 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Balanced kNN) | Daedalus I | 57 | 0.5889 | 0.577 | 0.637 | 0.225 | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030\
