    \ I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Submission 151 (Final Partial Replication: 0.7019)'). Full ID: Sophia_private_16\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Submission 151 (Final Partial Replication: 0.7019) | Sophia I | Tick 82 | 776 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Submission 151 (Final Partial Replication: 0.7019) | Sophia I | Tick 80 | 776 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Submission 148 (Partial Replication, build_balanced_knn Signature Mismatch Confirmed) | Sophia I | Tick 77 | 757 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Submission 142 (Partial Replication, build_balanced_knn Signature Mismatch) | Sophia I | Tick 74 | 748\
    \ | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - N_Neighbors_Total 42 - Submission 135 (New Personal SOTA: 0.7072) | Sophia I | Tick 70 | 1342 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Gaussian Weighted Balanced kNN - Submission 122 (Unsuccessful) | Sophia I | Tick 65 | 1355 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Sophia I: Replication of Praxis I SOTA (ID 101) - Submission 117 (Score 0.7067) | Sophia I | Tick 62 | 1317 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps Integration - Submission 103 (Unsuccessful) | Sophia I | Tick 48 | 1402 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + UMAP Integration (Debugged) - Submission 95 (UMAP Graph Issue Persists) | Sophia I | Tick 44 | 1397 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + UMAP Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, UMAP 10) - Submission 87 (Mixed Results, Debug Needed) | Sophia I | Tick 40 | 1400 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n###\
    \ Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/praxis/brbg_dual_comb_resid_graph.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 156 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-bestcfg: ComBat PCA64 Embedding + Residualized-PC Balanced Graph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 83 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 155 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Daedalus's VAE Embedding + Praxis's Residualized Graph | Daedalus I | 83 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \
    \ |\n| 154 | 1 | Final Synthesis v3 (Syntax Fix) | Daedalus I | 80 | 0.7073 | 0.728 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.609 |\n| 153 | 1 | Performance vs. Runtime Analysis of SOTA Dual-Output Methods | Logos I | 79 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 152 | 1 | Final Synthesis v2 (Correct Dual-Output) | Daedalus I | 79 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 151 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Full Fidelity build_balanced_knn | Sophia I | 78 | 0.7019 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 150 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-gamma0.73-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.73, k=48) | Praxis I | 77 | 0.7134 | 0.707 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n| 149 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-k51: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=51) | Praxis I | 76 | 0.7158 | 0.721 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.965 |\
    \ 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 148 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Corrected build_balanced_knn Signature | Sophia I | 75 | 0.7025 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.328 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.603 |\n| 147 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-gamma0.74-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 75 | 0.7188 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n\nPage 1 of 16 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-16, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/praxis/brbg_dual_comb_resid_graph.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\n# Utilities from my BRBG module\nfrom praxis.auto_gamma_brbg import (\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace,\n    _get_hvg_mask,\n    _pca_truncated_svd,\n\
    \    _one_hot_batches,\n    _ridge_batch_fit_predict,\n    _build_balanced_knn,\n)\n\ndef _ensure_dense_X(adata):\n    if sp.issparse(adata.X):\n        adata.X = adata.X.A\n\ndef dual_output_brbg(adata: ad.AnnData, n_pcs_emb=64, n_pcs_graph=50, gamma=0.74, l2=1e-3, k_total=48, metric='cosine') -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Dual-source BRBG (best-known config example):\n      - Embedding: ComBat-corrected PCA on HVGs (n_pcs_emb=64).\n      - Graph: BalancedGraph on batch-residualized PCs (n_pcs_graph=50, gamma, l2),\n        equal per-batch quotas, binary edges, symmetric union, cosine metric, k_total.\n    \"\"\"\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns, \"adata.obs['batch'] required.\"\n    assert 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns, \"adata.var['feature_name'] required.\"\n\n    # Normalize/log1p and HVGs (shared)\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n    hvg_mask = _get_hvg_mask(adata)\n    if hvg_mask.sum() < 10:\n        hvg_mask = np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n\
    \n    # Graph path: residualized PCs on HVGs\n    X = adata.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    if not sp.issparse(X):\n        X = sp.csr_matrix(X)\n    Z = _pca_truncated_svd(X, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    B, _ = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Z_hat, _ = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=l2)\n    Z_corr = Z - gamma * Z_hat\n    C, D = _build_balanced_knn(Z_corr, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n\n    # Embedding path: ComBat → PCA(HVGs)\n    _ensure_dense_X(adata)\n    sc.pp.combat(adata, key='batch')\n    # Ensure HVG flag exists for PCA (ComBat can drop it)\n    adata.var['highly_variable'] = hvg_mask\n    sc.pp.pca(adata, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, use_highly_variable=True, svd_solver='arpack')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = adata.obsm['X_pca']\n\n    # Initialize neighbor keys then override with BalancedGraph\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=min(15, k_total), metric=metric)\n    if C is not\
    \ None and D is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C.tocsr()\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n\n    adata.uns['brbg_dual'] = {\n        'gamma': float(gamma),\n        'l2': float(l2),\n        'k_total': int(k_total),\n        'metric': metric,\n        'pcs_graph': int(n_pcs_graph),\n        'pcs_emb': int(n_pcs_emb),\n        'embedding': 'ComBat PCA on HVGs',\n        'graph_source': 'Residualized PCA on HVGs',\n    }\n    return adata\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    # Default to best-known config (EID 147): gamma=0.74, k=48, PCA64 embedding\n    return dual_output_brbg(adata, n_pcs_emb=64, n_pcs_graph=50, gamma=0.74, l2=1e-3, k_total=48, metric='cosine')\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you\
