    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 169 | 1 | Generalization for Paper: Lower Gamma (0.70) | Daedalus I | 91 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 168 | 1 | Separation Analysis: ComBat PCA64 vs Residualized PC50 (Angles, Batch R^2, Overlap) | Praxis I | 90 | n.a. |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 167 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Import Fixed) | Aether I | 90 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 166 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat | Sophia I | 89 | 0.7383 | 0.742 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.710 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.865 |\n| 165 | 1 | Ablation for Paper v2 (Numba Fix) | Daedalus I | 89 | 0.6229 | 0.602 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.252 | 0.962 | 0.705 | 0.995 | 0.985 | 0.132 | 0.641 |\n| 164 | 1 | Baseline for Paper v2 (Output Fix) | Daedalus I | 89 | 0.5994 | 0.506 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.935 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.969 | 0.078 | 0.609 |\n| 163 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication | Aether I | 88 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 162 | 1 | Baseline for Paper: ComBat Embedding + Standard Graph | Daedalus I | 88 | 0.3174 | 0.506 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.935 | 0.685 | 0.000 | 0.969 | 0.078 |\
    \ 0.000 |\n| 161 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-CBKNN-narrow: Calibrated Balanced kNN with Narrow Clamp (0.8–1.25) | Praxis I | 87 | 0.7190 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.679 |\n| 160 | 1 | Ablation for Paper: VAE Embedding + Standard Graph | Daedalus I | 87 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 17 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-17, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
