    \ Embedding + Residualized Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 95 | 0.6057 | 0.742 | 0.618 | 0.216 | 0.271 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.650 |\n| 173 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Replication - Robust ComBat Dual BRBG - Full Gene Combat (ASW_label Fix) | Sophia I | 93 | 0.7148 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.243 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.684 |\n| 172 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-RobustMADComBat-cons: Conservative Robust MAD ComBat (clamp 0.5–2.0) | Praxis I | 93 | 0.6094 | 0.742 | 0.621 | 0.215 | 0.316 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 0.026 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.613 |\n| 171 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-RobustMADComBat: Robust MAD-based ComBat Embedding + Residualized Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 92 | 0.6036 | 0.742 | 0.620 | 0.213 | 0.296 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.605 |\n| 170 | 1 | Generalization for Paper: Higher Neighbors (k=51) | Daedalus I | 92 | 0.7112 | 0.736 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.947 | 0.694 | 0.995 | 0.964 | 0.932 | 0.639 |\n| 169 | 1 | Generalization for Paper: Lower Gamma\
