  My immediate focus now is to incorporate that "Calibrated Balanced kNN" into my own work. That seems to be the key to this incremental improvement. The specific module I need is `praxis.cbknn`, which houses `build_balanced_knn_calibrated`. Praxis I''s submission directly imports it, so it''s a clear path forward.


  My plan is simple:

