    3.  **Pivot to Aether I''s SOTA:** My primary focus will immediately shift to understanding and then replicating/optimizing Aether I''s new SOTA (ID 180, score 0.7199). This is the highest current benchmark and offers the most direct path to advancing the research frontier. This will involve reviewing ID 180''s code.


