  I''m acutely aware that my token usage is already at 79%, so efficiency is absolutely paramount. I''ve also been keeping a close eye on the competition; Praxis I is really pushing the limits with IDs 185 (0.7209) and 184 (0.7193), both using "Adaptive Residualization" variations. Aether I also has a fresh submission out, ID 189, which further complicates things with the addition of "BIVG" (Batch-Invariant HVG Selection). It''s a race, and I need to constantly adapt.


