    \ (0.9) in Residualized Graph | Logos II | 106 | 0.7077 | 0.724 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.339 | 0.946 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 185 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.9 (conservative per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7209 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.302 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 184 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC: gamma_max=0.75, lam=1.0 (per-PC adaptive residualization) | Praxis I | 106 | 0.7193 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.680 |\n| 183 | 1 | Novel Hybrid: Decoupled ComBat Embedding and Residualized Graph | Logos II | 105 | 0.7067 | 0.728 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 182 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-BIVG: Batch-Invariant HVG Selection + Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 104 | 0.7146 | 0.727 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.965 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.639 |\n| 181 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Calibrated Balanced kNN (CBKNN) - IORegistryError\
