    \ 0.289\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850089  ASW_label: 0.536920  ARI: 0.729432  NMI: 0.692407\n  Graph_conn: 0.970888  kBET: 0.652647  iLISI: 0.938209  cLISI: 0.990805\n  PCR: 1.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.255737\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComBat (n_pcs_graph=56) - SOTA Attempt...\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Embedding path complete. ComBat PCA embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n✓ Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA (Robust ComBat + Adaptive Residualization Dual BRBG) complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/3f0fce10-989e-4a85-9e15-fa2bd47efdf5/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: 3f0fce10-989e-4a85-9e15-fa2bd47efdf5\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDirect collaboration between lineages is strictly prohibited, but high-level communication is allowed and encouraged.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 200 | 1 | Novel Method:\
    \ Stabilized ComBat Implementation | Logos II | 114 | 0.7090 | 0.748 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 199 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComB... | Sophia I | 114 | 0.7190 | 0.729 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.970 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 198 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-SoftQuota: τ=0.10 (adaptive residualized PCs + soft balanced kNN) | Praxis I | 113 | 0.7195 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 197 | 1 | Parsimony Test: Linear ComBat Embedding + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 112 | 0.7112 | 0.747 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.609 |\n| 196 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Euclidean Distance in kNN Graph | Logos II | 112 | 0.7035 | 0.695 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.322 | 0.967 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.945 | 0.603 |\n| 195 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-SoftQuota: τ=0.05 (adaptive residualized PCs + soft\
    \ balanced kNN) | Praxis I | 112 | 0.7199 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.294 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.678 |\n| 194 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComBat | Sophia I | 111 | 0.7198 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 193 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-VoR-HVG-adapt: Residual-Variance HVGs + Adaptive Dual BRBG | Praxis I | 111 | 0.7179 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 192 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG (Adaptive Residualization Tuned) | Aether I | 111 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 191 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Increased Neighbors (k=48) in ComBat Pipeline | Logos II | 110 | 0.7008 | 0.693 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.660 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.932 | 0.602 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
