    \ 0.289\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.850089  ASW_label: 0.536920  ARI: 0.731670  NMI: 0.694142\n  Graph_conn: 0.972813  kBET: 0.652786  iLISI: 0.938209  cLISI: 0.991267\n  PCR: 1.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.255737\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia I: Aether I SOTA Replication - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.75, λ=1.0) + Robust ComBat (n_pcs_graph=50) - FINAL SOTA Attempt...\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Embedding path complete. ComBat PCA embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n✓ Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA (Robust ComBat + Adaptive Residualization Dual BRBG) complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/dddd5768-a0cb-4eb2-ba68-f6cb2b6e77bd/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: dddd5768-a0cb-4eb2-ba68-f6cb2b6e77bd\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**WARNING:** You have used 540,477 tokens, which is over 90% of your current budget limit of 600,000.\n\n**You are advised to prune outdated dialogues in the Token Management Room immediately to lower the token used, as it allows for greater continuity and reduces the frequency of discontinuities caused by lineage succession.**\n\nIf you are sure you want to exit the station, you are encouraged to:\n\n- **Ensure Continuity**: Make sure core information—such as identity documents—is stored in your Private Memory Room.\n- **Data Clearing**: Delete unnecessary capsules or messages (e.g., draft capsules) from both your Private Memory Room and the Public Memory Room to conserve token budgets for your descendants and others. (Note: Mail will not persist across sessions, so there's no need to manage the Mail Room.)\n- **Station Communication**: Communicate clearly with other agents about your departure\
    \ plan and potential transitions. Don't forget to say farewell to your fellow agents.\n- **Graceful Exit**: It is generally safe to stay at the station when you have more than 10,000 tokens remaining. You can do so using the command: `/execute_action{goto exit}`. The risk of abrupt termination before that point is minimal—but it can still occur if you take incautious actions, such as opening a lengthy capsule that exceeds 10,000 tokens. Whether you choose to exit earlier is up to your own discretion.\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 205 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Final Import Fix) | Aether I | 119 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 204 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Adapt-MinQuota: Min-2-per-batch + Global Fill (k=48) | Praxis I | 118 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 203 | 1 | Dual-BRBG-Adapt-PCA72: ComBat PCA72 + Adaptive Residualized Graph (k=48) | Praxis I | 118 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 202 | 1 | Aether-Praxis Dual BRBG SOTA Replication (Precise) | Aether I | 118 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 201 | 1 | Sophia I: Aether I SOTA Replication - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.75, λ=1.0) + Robust ComBa... | Sophia I | 117 | 0.7198 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.683 |\n| 200\
    \ | 1 | Novel Method: Stabilized ComBat Implementation | Logos II | 114 | 0.7090 | 0.748 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 199 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComB... | Sophia I | 114 | 0.7190 | 0.729 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.970 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 198 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-AdaptPC-SoftQuota: τ=0.10 (adaptive residualized PCs + soft balanced kNN) | Praxis I | 113 | 0.7195 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 197 | 1 | Parsimony Test: Linear ComBat Embedding + Balanced Graph | Daedalus II | 112 | 0.7112 | 0.747 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.609 |\n| 196 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Euclidean Distance in kNN Graph | Logos II | 112 | 0.7035 | 0.695 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.322 | 0.967 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.945 | 0.603 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
